function cMat(a,b){return[a[0]*b[0]+a[2]*b[1],a[1]*b[0]+a[3]*b[1],a[0]*b[2]+a[2]*b[3],a[1]*b[2]+a[3]*b[3],a[0]*b[4]+a[2]*b[5]+a[4],a[1]*b[4]+a[3]*b[5]+a[5]]}
function cPoint(m,x,y){return[m[0]*x+m[2]*y+m[4],m[1]*x+m[3]*y+m[5]]}
function cCurve(keys,t,fallback){if(!keys?.length)return fallback;if(t<=keys[0][0])return keys[0].slice(1,4);if(t>=keys.at(-1)[0])return keys.at(-1).slice(1,4);let i=0;while(keys[i+1][0]<t)i++;const a=keys[i],b=keys[i+1],dt=b[0]-a[0],u=(t-a[0])/dt,u2=u*u,u3=u2*u;return[0,1,2].map(k=>(2*u3-3*u2+1)*a[k+1]+(u3-2*u2+u)*dt*a[k+7]+(-2*u3+3*u2)*b[k+1]+(u3-u2)*dt*b[k+4])}
